  g1: "1 · HW1" {class: port; tooltip: "**GOP** · 1 — over HWSCL1\n\nOurs: the menu in the recording and photo [R] ‖ **GOP** · 1 — над HWSCL1\n\nУ нас: меню в записи и фото [R]"}
  g2: "2 · HW2" {class: port; tooltip: "**GOP** · 2 — over HWSCL2\n\nOurs: the menu on USB [R] ‖ **GOP** · 2 — над HWSCL2\n\nУ нас: меню на USB [R]"}
  g3: "3 · HW3" {class: port; tooltip: "**GOP** · 3 — over HWSCL3\n\nOurs: the menu over the zoom frames, both channels [R] ‖ **GOP** · 3 — над HWSCL3\n\nУ нас: меню над кадрами зума, оба канала [R]"}
